GET {{baseUrl}}/api/playlists/me

### PL13. Duyệt public -> 200, totalElements 2: My Public và Admin Public (không có 2 playlist private)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/playlists/public
Authorization: Bearer {{loginUser.response.body.accessToken}}

